Claro! Abaixo está um arquivo HTML único, estilizado com **Bootstrap 5.3**, contendo um mapa interativo (biblioteca **Leaflet** com tiles do **OpenStreetMap** — funciona sem precisar de chave de API) com os 4 pontos turísticos marcados, títulos, legenda animada, cartões de detalhe e o rodapé com a frase solicitada.

**Como usar:** salve o código como `mapa-belem.html` e abra no navegador (precisa de conexão com a internet para carregar os recursos).

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" data-bs-theme="dark">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#083a27">
  <title>Mapa Turístico de Belém do Pará</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Mapa interativo dos pontos turísticos de Belém do Pará: Mercado Ver-o-Peso, Teatro da Paz, Bosque Rodrigues Alves e Praça Batista Campos.">

  <!-- Bootstrap 5.3 -->
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <!-- Leaflet + OpenStreetMap -->
  <link href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    /* =========================================
       ESTILOS GERAIS
       ========================================= */
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      background: #f3f6f5;
      color: #1b2623;
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100%;
    }

    /* =========================================
       BARRA DE NAVEGAÇÃO
       ========================================= */
    .navbar-custom {
      background: linear-gradient(115deg, #083a27 0%, #0f5f3c 55%, #177a51 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, .25);
      padding: .35rem 0;
    }
    .navbar-brand {
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      letter-spacing: .4px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .4rem;
    }
    .navbar-custom .navbar-nav .navbar-nav-link {
      color: #eceff4;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: .9rem;
    }

    /* =========================================
       CABEÇALHO
       ========================================= */
    .cabecalho-site {
      background: linear-gradient(155deg, #0a2c21 0%, #061f17 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 2rem 0 1rem;
    }
    .cabecalho-site h1 {
      font-size: 1.85rem;
      margin: 0 0 .3rem;
      letter-spacing: -.3px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .cabecalho-site .kicker {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1.6px;
      font-size: .75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #8fd1a8;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: .3rem;
    }
    .cabecalho-site p {
      color: #dbeae0;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: .95rem;
      margin: .25rem 0 0;
      max-width: 780px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }
    .cabecalho-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: .8rem;
      margin: .75rem auto 0;
      max-width: 920px;
    }
    .instrucao {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .075);
      border-left: 4px solid #e67e22;
      border-radius: 0 .25rem .25rem 0;
      padding: .55rem .9rem;
      margin: .6rem auto 0;
      max-width: 920px;
      font-size: .9rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: .5rem;
    }

    /* =========================================
       ÁREA DO MAPA + CARTÕES
       ========================================= */
    .area-mapa { padding: 1rem 0; }
    .grid-mapa {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0;
      min-height: 0;
    }
    .card-mapa {
      flex: 1 1 auto;
      min-height: 340px;
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #e5ebe7;
      border-radius: .5rem;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, .22);
    }
    #map {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0;
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      z-index: 10;
      user-select: none;
      -webkit-user-select: none;
      background: #ddcdd1;
    }
    .rotulo-mapa {
      position: absolute;
      pointer-events: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      line-height: 1.18;
      letter-spacing: .4px;
      color: #3c4a47;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .9);
      border: .5px solid #cfd8cf;
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 2.5px 7px;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, .15);
    }

    /* =========================================
       LATERAL (LEGENDA + DETALHES)
       ========================================= */
    .lateral {
      min-width: 270px;
      max-width: 440px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .lateral .card {
      background: #fff;
      border: none;
      border-radius: .5rem;
      margin-bottom: .75rem;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 11px rgba(0, 0, 0, .12);
    }
    .lateral hr.m-0 { border-color: #eef3f2; margin: 0; }
    .dot {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 22px; height: 22px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: .65rem;
      color: #fff;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-right: 7px;
    }
    .lateral h5 { font-size: 1rem; color: #0b3d2e; margin-bottom: .2rem; }
    .info-tag {
      background: #eaf5ee;
      color: #135d3a;
      font-size: .78rem;
      padding: .2em .55rem;
      border-radius: 99px;
      margin-top: .35em;
    }
    .badge-mini {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: .74em;
      padding: .1em .35em;
      border-radius: 99px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: .3px;
    }
    .legend-area { margin-top: .3rem; }
    .legend-titulo {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      font-size: .78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #5d8a58;
      margin: .35rem 0 .2rem;
    }
    .lista-legenda {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .lista-legenda li {
      margin: .18rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef;
      transition: .2s;
      background: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .5rem;
      border-radius: 0;
    }
    .lista-legenda li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .lista-legenda li:hover { background: #f7faf9; }
    .lista-legenda li.item-destacada {
      background: #f4f6f5;
      border-left: 3px solid #e67e22;
    }

    /* Cartões de detalhe com revelação animada */
    .detail-wrap { margin-top: .35rem; }
    .det-card {
      display: block;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(8px);
      transition: transform .28s ease, box-shadow .28s ease, opacity .28s ease;
    }
    .det-card-aberto { display: block; opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    .det-card-vero   { border-left: 6px solid #B35A0C;  box-shadow: 0 2px 11px rgba(0,0,0,.14) }
    .det-card-teatro { border-left: 6px solid #1A5276;  box-shadow: 0 2px 11px rgba(0,0,0,.14) }
    .det-card-bosque { border-left: 6px solid #1E8449;  box-shadow: 0 2px 11px rgba(0,0,0,.14) }
    .det-card-batista{ border-left: 6px solid #B9770E;  box-shadow: 0 2px 11px rgba(0,0,0,.14) }
    .det-card .card-body { padding: .65rem .75rem; }

    /* =========================================
       POPUPS DO MAPA
       ========================================= */
    .meu-pupo {
      max-width: 300px;
      min-width: 215px;
      background: #fbfcfd;
      border: 1px solid #e7ebe7;
      border-radius: .45rem;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, .22);
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.42;
      padding: 0;
      z-index: 9999;
      position: relative;
    }
    .meu-pupo .pop-head {
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: .3em .7em -1em;
      border-radius: .3rem;
      padding: .45em .65em;
      color: #222826;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .meu-pupo.vero .pop-head    { background: #B35A0C; color: #fff; }
    .meu-pudo.teatro .pop-head  { background: #1A5276; color: #fff; }
    .meu-pudo.bosque .pop-head  { background: #1E8449; color: #fff; }
    .meu-pudo.batista .pop-head { background: #B9770E; color: #fff; }
    .meu-pupo .pop-body {
      padding: .75em .85em;
      color: #3c4a47;
    }
    .meu-pupo .text-muted { font-size: .85em; }
    .meu-pupo::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      height: 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(255,255,255,.55), transparent);
    }

    /* =========================================
       MARCADORES (PINOS)
       ========================================= */
    .marcador-pino {
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform .3s cubic-bezier(.33,0,.68,1), box-shadow .3s;
    }
    .marcador-pino:hover {
      transform: scale(1.18);
      box-shadow: 0 0 9px rgba(0,0,0,.4), 0 0 0 3px rgba(255,255,255,.35);
    }
    .marcador-pino.pino-selecionada {
      transform: scale(1.05);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px 2px rgba(251,196,15,.55);
    }
    .marcador-pino:active { transform: scale(.93); }

    /* =========================================
       RODAPÉ
       ========================================= */
    .site-footer {
      background: #0c241a;
      color: #cdd9cf;
      border-top: 1px solid #1c3c30;
      padding: 1.3rem 0;
      font-size: .88rem;
